}

docs {
  # Get All Trip History By Driver ID

  This request is used to get all trip history by given `driver_id`. This request interacts with the MySQL database, has a protected routes, and a pagination.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name      | Type   | Required | Description | Example                               |
  |-----------|--------|----------|--------------|------------------------------------------|
  | driver_id | string | yes      | Driver ID   | 28668090-5653-dff5-2d8f-af603fc36b45   |

  ## Responses

  **200 — Trip fetched successfully.** Ordered in descending order by `created_at`
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "trip fetched",
    "data": {
      "current_page": 1,
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "28668090-5653-dff5-2d8f-af603fc36b45",
          "vehicle_name": "Brio RS MT",
          "vehicle_plate_number": "D 1610 ZBC",
          "trip_desc": "jalan2",
          "trip_category": "Others",
          "trip_origin_name": "Budi House",
          "trip_person": "Budi",
          "trip_origin_coordinate": "-6.252640549671855, 106.76424433238519",
          "trip_destination_name": "Central Park",
          "trip_destination_coordinate": "-6.177464532426197, 106.7912179194768",
          "created_at": "2025-06-19 07:54:42"
        }
      ],
      "last_page": 1,
      "per_page": 14,
      "total": 1
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — trip failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "trip history not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}